THE FINDING, MADE AGAIN on the file. Since Review 79 main's side exits with status 0 on its first look, printing FIRST LOOK and where every branch is. The docstring said that it exits when a branch has moved, appeared or gone, and its line on --once said status 0 if there is something new.

Both say it now, with a dated note. A test holds what the listener does on its first look, and that the docstring says it. No behaviour is changed. 0 of 19.
